---
// Praxis documentation is dark-only, matching praxisfleet.com, which has no
// light theme at all. Starlight's stock provider reads localStorage and then
// falls back to prefers-color-scheme, so on a light-configured machine a
// reader arriving from the marketing site would jump from #09090b to white.
//
// This pins the theme to dark instead. Inlined like upstream so the attribute
// is set before first paint and there is no flash.
//
// `ThemeSelect` is overridden to render nothing, but Starlight components can
// still call `updatePickers()`, so it stays defined and inert.
---

<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
  window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} };
</script>
